  "additional_limits": [
    "Wi-Fi uses no access points. Empty scan, hidden SSID/password, and failed connection are captured; real AP lists, saved credentials, forget/save prompts, successful connections, and downstream network responses are not.",
    "BLE menu, enable, scan/no peers, and empty paired list are captured. Pairing, remote mapping/learning, disconnect/failure, and persisted peer states need an emulated or physical BLE peer.",
    "Crash is a GDB-forced second isRebootFromPanic return, not a real crash; SD error is an emulated SD-card eject before mount. Neither proves recovery or hardware fault behavior.",
    "Stock English text and built-in fonts only. Arbitrary translations, installed fonts, books, library sizes, content layout variants, and every setting combination are outside this finite matrix.",
    "OOM, corrupted cache, failing writes, update success, intermediate loading paints, every popup selection, and every touch/remapping path are not exhaustively injected. Reader and sleep images cover representative grayscale paths.",
    "Nonreader screens are portrait; EPUB and its children use all four orientations. XTC explicitly forces portrait. Sleep ignores inversion by design; both requested polarities are retained.",
    "Details and Frontlight fixture-entry groups require the local instrumented ui_oracle build. They prove activity pixels and refresh policy with synthetic data/capabilities, not network or hardware behavior. fixture-unknown and fixture-oversized prove rejected selectors preserve Home. See FIXTURE-GAPS.md for remaining state families and proposed seams."
  ]
}
